# Türkçe (Turkish) language pack for MXBMRP3 - BETA.
# Drafted for 1.35; not yet reviewed line by line by a native speaker.
# Corrections are welcome: see README.md in the parent folder.
# Ğ ğ İ ı Ş ş are drawn by every shipped font from 1.35 on.
#
# Glossary (keep these consistent):
#   rider = sürücü, bike = motor, lap = tur, sector = sektör, split = ara,
#   gap = fark (the Gap Bar HUD = Fark Barı), PB = PB / kişisel en iyi,
#   standings = sıralama, pits = pit, penalty = ceza, session = seans,
#   practice = antrenman, qualify = kalifikasyon, race = yarış,
#   settings = ayarlar, hotkeys = kısayollar, rumble = titreşim,
#   notice/toast = bildirim, callout = anons, achievement = başarım,
#   profile = profil, crash = kaza, controller = kontrolcü,
#   race number = yarış no, web overlay = web overlay,
#   On/Off = Açık/Kapalı, Default = Varsayılan. Ordinals: 1. 2. 3.
#   Kept in English as players say them: HUD, Dash, Companion, widget,
#   spotter, holeshot, whip, scrub, oppo, endo, stoppie, wheelie, backflip,
#   frontflip, turn down, FMX, OBS. RPM stays English.
